recompiler emits it as a switch-case label. It is reached only by the runtime-computed
`jalr a2` in sub_005B0E30 (a2 = record-array entry 0x0088684C), so the control-flow analyzer
cannot statically discover it. Without it the SIF0 dispatch lands on "no generated function".

